00:00:13.714 --> 00:00:17.584 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Selon le premier ministre,

00:00:15.249 --> 00:00:18.819 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il est moins virulent et nous

00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:20.020 size:53% position:73% line:53%
