00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:21.255 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sera bientôt derrirerere-nous.

00:00:18.919 --> 00:00:22.489 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le nombre d'infections,

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.690 size:53% position:73% line:53%
