00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:24.925 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et selon les experts,

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:26.927 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on a atteint, il y a quelques

00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:29.930 size:53% position:73% line:53%
