00:00:41.642 --> 00:00:45.212 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Il y aura un couvre-fe

00:00:42.843 --> 00:00:47.014 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est un geste qui est extrême

00:00:44.078 --> 00:00:48.215 size:53% position:73% line:53%
