00:00:50.751 --> 00:00:56.323 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(cris d'enfants)

00:00:54.021 --> 00:00:57.858 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 E : : : : la rentrée scolaire.

00:00:55.222 --> 00:01:02.730 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La santé publique ne croit pas

00:00:56.423 --> 00:01:03.730 size:53% position:73% line:53%
