00:01:18.779 --> 00:01:22.349 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et un plan de contingence

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:23.584 size:53% position:73% line:53%
est en place.

00:01:21.215 --> 00:01:25.119 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On ne demande pas aux parents

00:01:22.449 --> 00:01:26.653 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de devenir des enseignants

00:01:23.684 --> 00:01:28.155 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ni de devenir des supp

00:01:25.219 --> 00:01:29.556 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il est possible que de manière

00:01:26.754 --> 00:01:31.091 size:53% position:73% line:53%
exceptionnelle, en dernier

00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:32.593 size:53% position:73% line:53%
recours, temporairement,

00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:34.128 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Mais il y a un groupe 

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:35.662 size:53% position:73% line:53%
n'est pas près de sabrer le

00:01:32.693 --> 00:01:37.664 size:53% position:73% line:53%
