00:01:46.607 --> 00:01:50.143 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ce qu'on ne voulait pas,

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:51.378 size:53% position:73% line:53%
surtout, c'eetetetetetette

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:52.613 size:53% position:73% line:53%
exigence-là, comme l'a dit le

00:01:50.244 --> 00:01:53.814 size:53% position:73% line:53%
